Debian 13 armhf stage-1 development image for Luckfox Pico Zero.

Development login:
  user: luckfox
  password: luckfox

This credential is intentionally limited to the bring-up image and must not be
used for production. Original uClibc IPC applications are not installed.

BlueZ and the AIC8800 UART attach service are configured, but Bluetooth HCI and
radio operation still require physical-board validation.

Run `sudo luckfox-stage1-validate --help` for the staged hardware acceptance
checks. Network access, APT updates and Bluetooth scanning require explicit
options; the validator never reboots or changes Wi-Fi configuration.
